WEBVTT

00:00:28.125 --> 00:00:30.059
One on each arm,

00:00:30.083 --> 00:00:32.018
two on each leg,

00:00:32.042 --> 00:00:37.309
and the seventh man held Alton's neck
in a vice-like grip

00:00:37.333 --> 00:00:39.143
between his forearms.

00:00:39.167 --> 00:00:41.226
And Alton was struggling for breath

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:43.184
and saying, "I can't breathe,"

00:00:43.208 --> 00:00:46.750
just as George Floyd said,
"I can't breathe."

00:00:47.833 --> 00:00:50.018
But they didn't stop.

00:00:50.042 --> 00:00:53.167
And soon, Alton was dead.

00:00:55.042 --> 00:01:01.726
When I was asked to represent
his mother and his brother and his sister